r how much or how little  you make you can still do a whole lot of  stupid I've known people who make much  lower incomes and I then people often  say how do you survive on that and they  don't have to provide big drives because  they have a plan what we did is we  decided we're going to live within our  means whatever those means are we're  going to give first we're going to save  second and we're going to continue to  focus on our dreams it wasn't that we  ever had a lot of money it wasn't that  we ever saved everything we lived a  lifestyle that we could talk about and  that fit our dreams and enabled us to  get to the point where we are today so I  really want to say to the people out  there that it is possible to live your  dreams and to be excited and  enthusiastically pursuit life and you  will achieve what you want if you want  it bad enough  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  [Music]
 

